    | 4.1 Population Size, Growth And Distribution
    | 4.1.1 Population Size and Growth
    | The population of Pakistan according to the Census-2023 has been recorded as 241.50 million
    | (241,499,431), showing an increase of 33.81 million 16.28% from the previous Census of 2017.
